7. The applicant shall also abide by the following conditions of Section 480(3) B.N.S.S. as under:-
(a) that such person shall attend in accordance with the conditions of the bond executed under this Chapter;
(b) that such person shall not commit any offence similar to the offence of which she is accused, or suspected of the commission of which she is suspected and;
(c) that such person shall not directly or indirectly make any inducement, threat or promise to any person acquainted with the facts of the NEUTRAL CITATION NO.
2024:MPHC-JBP:50796 3 MCRC-41975-2024 case as to dissuade her from disclosing such facts to the Court or to any police officer or tamper with the evidence.

